        "title": "OAuthClientConnection",
        "description": "One connection authorized through an organization's own OAuth client.\n\nThis is the admin's view of \"who has connected through my app\": the account, who started the\nflow (``null`` for connections made by the organization's backend with an API key), and when.\nDisconnecting stays on the connector's own installation routes."
      },
